= Declaration of neutrality

<div style="display: flex; padding: 10px; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; max-width: 500px; flex-wrap: wrap;">

  <img class="face-status" src="img/d_rose.jpg" style="flex-shrink: 0; width: 120px; height: auto;">

  <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 0;">
    <p style="margin: 0;">
      Despite the democratic majority of the Reichstag agreeing with Braun and Joos's measures, in practice the minor right-leaning parties are only paying lip service to the fact. With the DVP itself declaring neutrality.
    </p>
  </div>

</div>

- @title: Now we wait

@title

They state that they will watch as the situation unfolds, and if needed will support a side. Which side they will support will be up to them, but as the right seems to have the upper hand, we can only hope that their left wing can influence them enough into supporting them.

